# Post Deployment Steps – CXHHC-49831 Availability Management translations

## Prerequisites

1. Log in to the target org as a System Administrator.
2. Go to **Setup > Translation Workbench > Translation Language Settings**.
3. Check that **French** is listed and **Active**. If not, click **Add**, select **French**, tick **Active**, and **Save**.
4. Edit **French** and add your user to **Assigned Translators**. Click **Save**.

---

## Section 1 – Translate the Availability Management object and its fields

### 1.1 Object label

1. Go to **Setup > User Interface > Rename Tabs and Labels**.
2. Set **Select Language** to **French**.
3. Under **Custom Tabs / Objects**, click **Edit** next to **Availability Management**.
4. Fill in the values below and click **Next**, then **Save**.

| Field | English label | French label |
|---|---|---|
| Singular | Availability Management | Gestion des disponibilités |
| Plural | Availability Managements | Gestions des disponibilités |
| Record Name | Availability Management Name | Nom de la gestion des disponibilités |

### 1.2 Field labels

1. Go to **Setup > Translation Workbench > Translate**.
2. Set **Language** to **French**.
3. Set **Setup Component** to **Custom Field**.
4. Set **Object** to **Availability Management**.
5. For each row below, double-click the **Field Label Translation** cell, enter the French label, and press **Enter**.
6. Click **Save**.

| API Name | English label | French label |
|---|---|---|
| FSCO_Active__c | Active | Actif |
| FSCO_Capacity__c | Capacity | Capacité |
| FSCO_CapacityType__c | Capacity Type | Type de capacité |
| FSCO_DateSelectionType__c | Date Selection Type | Type de sélection de date |
| FSCO_Description__c | Description | Description |
| FSCO_MultipleDates__c | Multiple Dates | Dates multiples |
| FSCO_NumberOfBlock__c | Number of Block | Nombre de blocs |
| FSCO_PeriodFrom__c | Period From | Période du |
| FSCO_PeriodTo__c | Period To | Période au |
| FSCO_ReservationMode__c | Reservation Mode | Mode de réservation |
| FSCO_ServiceTerritory__c | Service Territory | Territoire de service |
| FSCO_Typology__c | Typology | Typologie |
| FSCO_TypologyDays__c | Typology Days | Jours de typologie |
| FSCO_WorkType__c | Work Type | Type de travail |
| TEKCO_Brand__c | Brand | Marque |
| TEKCO_Country__c | Country | Pays |
| TEKCO_DataMigrationId__c | Data Migration Id | ID de migration des données |
| TEKCO_ExternalId__c | External ID | ID externe |
| TEKCO_FHIRId__c | FHIR Id | ID FHIR |
| TEKCO_Resources__c | Resources | Ressources |

### 1.3 Verification

1. Set your user language to **French**.
2. Open an Availability Management record.
3. Check that the object name and all field labels appear in French.

