## Section 2 – Translate the "Dedicated Slot" Work Type visit type

1. Go to **Setup > Translation Workbench > Translate**.
2. Set **Language** to **French**.
3. Set **Setup Component** to **Picklist Value**.
4. Set **Object** to **Global Value Set**.
5. Select the value set **Work Type Visit Types** (`ACCCO_WorkTypeVisitTypes`).
6. Find the row for **Dedicated Slot** (API value `036`).
7. Double-click the **Translation** cell and enter **Créneau dédié**.
8. Click **Save**.
9. To verify, switch your user language to **French**, open a Work Type with visit type `036`, and check that **Visit Type** shows **Créneau dédié**.

---

## Section 3 – Rename the "Manage Increasing Time" button on Service Territory

1. Go to **Setup > Translation Workbench > Translate**.
2. Set **Language** to **French**.
3. Set **Setup Component** to **Quick Action**.
4. Set **Object** to **Service Territory**.
5. Find the action **FSCO_ManageIncreasingTime** (English label **Manage Increasing Time**).
6. Double-click the **Label Translation** cell and enter **Gestion des réserves de temps**.
7. Click **Save**.
8. To verify, switch your user language to **French**, open a Service Territory record, and check that the button reads **Gestion des réserves de temps**.
